{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52005","headline":"咏怀 · 王绩","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑榆汾水北，烟火浊河东。\n未必寻归路，居然息转蓬。\n故乡行处（《全唐诗》作「云」）是，虚室坐间同。\n日落西山暮，方知天下空。\n（按：《韵诗阳秋》卷十一、《全唐诗》卷三七收後四句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}